# Nothing in this tree is tracked. The .out files are process output (1,200+ of
# them, 14 MB) and manifests/ is a machine-written job_id -> command index.
#
# Both still matter locally: archive/20260806/ is the only surviving copy of
# alllocus_run's job output, and results/experiments/alllocus_run/
# reconstruct_from_logs.py needs the manifests to rebuild a run from it. Keep
# them on the filesystem; they are not for the remote.
*
!.gitignore
